"text": "Stop losing the things you copy on Windows.\nWindows can keep a history of them, you just have to turn it on.\nPress the Windows key and V.\nSee that Turn on button?\nClick it.\nNow copy a few things, a link, a photo, some text.\nPress Windows and V again.\nBoom, everything you copied, ready to paste.\nPin the ones you use every day, they stay even after a restart.\nFollow for more Windows tricks.\nBecause you should never lose what you copy again."
